                "title": "Victorian Plate with Hartford Knob, Brass Accents D05-K447-HAR",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K447-HAR, Victorian Plate with Hartford - The Victorian Plate with Hartford Knob features a very ornate design. Every inch of this latchset is dripping with elegance, from the beautiful backplate to the Crystal Harford Knob. It is available in a wide array of finishes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Ornate Victorian Plate with Crystal Hartford Knob will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
